ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh253: OPEN_SHELL with TWO ADVANCED_FACEs, coplanar (z=0) and ADJACENT (not coincident): Face A unit square x:[0,1],y:[0,1] with boundary edge along y=0 traversed (0,0,0)->(1,0,0); Face B unit square x:[0,1],y:[-1,-0.0005] with its corresponding boundary edge along y=-0.0005 traversed in the OPPOSITE direction (1,-0.0005,0)->(0,-0.0005,0), under the ordinary CCW/outward-+Z-normal convention -- a clean, genuinely non-degenerate cross-pairing merge candidate, second independent demonstration distinct from Tsh176's coincident opposite-facing (degenerate, shape_null==True) collapse */
